WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.420
- Well, it seemed inevitable,

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:03.570
but now Mike Lindell, the My Pillow guy,

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.830
has joined the ranks of people

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:06.560
like Sydney Powell and Rudy Giuliani

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:08.760
who are being sued for billions of dollars

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.580
related to alleged defamation damages

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.450
related to all the crazy
things that they were saying

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.780
about the elections.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.580
I've done lots of videos on how crazy

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:17.670
all of these things were,

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.380
but it's no surprise that Dominion,

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.650
one of the makers of these
election-related machines,

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:22.900
has sued Mike Lindell

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:24.280
for huge amounts of damages

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:25.540
that they have allegedly suffered

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.380
to their business and reputation.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.010
Pro tip for anyone that is thinking

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:30.430
about committing defamation

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.190
against other people or businesses,

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:34.440
maybe don't create a whole documentary

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:36.450
called "Absolute Proof,"
where you document

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:38.400
all of the crazy nonsensical things

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.160
that you want to say that
are allegedly defamatory,

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.410
but you know, #NotLegalAdvice,

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.810
but anyway, subscribe or
I'll see you in court,

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:47.510
especially if you're Mike Lindell.

